{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And he said: What shall I give you.</b> For that labor that you did with me." "<b>And Jacob said: You shall not give me anything.</b> For that labor, for it was for a woman that I labored. But if you wish that I return to tend your flocks, do this thing for me and then I shall return to tend your flocks."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:47.062762844Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}